			"locked": false,
			"text": "Backend API Server\n\n 8 vCPU\n 32 GB RAM\n Handles ≈ 400 RPS\n\nDB Server\n 4 vCPU\n 32 GB RAM\n\n2 TB storage usable\n\nCache Server (Redis)\n 8 vCPU\n 64 GB RAM\n usable cache ≈ 50 GB\n\nStorage Node\n 100 TB usable disk\n\nRule:\n Always 2× redundancy minimum",
